## Architecture mapping (web → native)

- useChargingSessionDetail  → ChargingDetailPageClientFeed (Registration.SessionOperation =
                              get_api_v1_charging_sessionID, GET /charging/{id}) — primary read; its
                              failure drives the page error state. (NB: Operations.Charging.SessionDetail
                              names a DIFFERENT endpoint /charging-sessions/{id}; the correct op id is
                              pinned in ChargingDetailPageRegistration.)
- useChargeTelemetry         → ChargingDetailPageClientFeed (TelemetryOperation =
                              get_api_v1_charging_sessionID_telemetry, GET /charging/{id}/telemetry) —
                              best-effort; powers the charge curve + 3 time-axis charts.
- useVehicle                 → ChargingDetailPageClientFeed (VehicleOperation =
                              get_api_v1_vehicles_vehicleID, GET /vehicles/{id}) — best-effort; header name.
- useChargingTelemetryLatest → ChargingDetailPageClientFeed (LatestOperation =
                              get_api_v1_charging_telemetry_latest, GET /charging-telemetry/latest?vehicle_id=)
                              — best-effort; powers the Advanced Charging Parameters panel.
- useUnits / convert{Distance,Temp,Energy,Power}FromSI / formatEnergy
                             → UnitConverters.*FromSi + UnitFormatters.FormatEnergy at the display
                              boundary (SI on the wire: Wh, W, m, °C). UnitPref flows ViewModel →
                              ChargingDetailProjection.Project(... units ...).
- useFormatting (costPerKwh / currencySymbol) → projection costPerKwh + currencySymbol parameters
                              (ViewModel defaults $/0.15, the web settings surface).
- i18n t(...)                → ILocalizer.GetString(webKey, englishDefault) via ChargingDetailStrings.Resolve;
                              web key names preserved verbatim; the dynamic charging-state badge resolves
                              `charging.detail.chargingState.{State}` with the raw state as fallback.
- web helpers isDC / durationMinutes / distanceAddedM / kwhPerHour / synthesizeCurve
                             → ChargingDetailProjection.{IsDc,DurationMinutes,DistanceAddedM,KwhPerHour,
                              SynthesizeCurve} (ported verbatim; unit-tested).
- ChartTimeRangeProvider / synced cursor / Brush → the W3 native TsCartesianChart cursor-sync surface
                              (cosmetic; the parity unit is the chart bodies, bound from the projection).

