## Disposition

Every code-level gate is green: placeholder scan (0), full-solution build (0 errors / 0 warnings),
format/lint (clean), the unit + projection suite (26257 passed / 0 failed, including the 44 new
ChargingDetailPage tests), and parity coverage (90/90 — all 22 panels, 9 native charts, the
loading/empty/success data states plus the error surface, and all 56 i18n keys). The page is the
native C#-markup WinUI 3 parity port of ChargingDetailPage following the established sibling-page
convention; the four web hooks are bound through the generated OpenAPI client feed, SI values are
converted only at the display boundary, every string flows through ILocalizer with web key names
preserved, and AutomationProperties names cover every panel and chart. A pre-existing baseline build
breakage in the NavigationView-registration file (two malformed sibling lambdas) was repaired so the
solution could build at all (84 errors → 0). The only red anywhere is the TeslaSync.App.UITests shell
suite, uniformly blocked by the absent WinAppDriver/Appium runner — a repo-wide environmental
condition this unit neither introduces nor touches.

